["36816"]={["Title"]="突袭破碎悬崖", ["Objectives"]="消灭掉尽可能多的影月兽人和他们的虚空爪牙。", ["Description"]="[PH]Commander! You just missed a group of rangari with some disturbing news. The Shadowmoon Orcs have been spotted in the hills above Anguish Fortress. The scouts reported seeing strange rituals and beings of pure darkness. Those orcs must be up there trying to summon more minions from the Void!NEW_LINENEW_LINEIf we do not intervene all we have gained in Shadowmoon Valley might be lost!", ["Progress"]="", ["Completion"]="", ["Translator"]=""},
